        <p>Postscript vs Brevo: scenario 1 — high-AOV cart with financing widget opened. At $280 AOV and 42% margin, full-price recovery contributes $117.6 vs $81.2 after a 13% code (Δ $36.4). Ladder touch 1 favors push nudge; watch for duplicate SMS and email within 20 minutes. Email 1 ~100m, email 2 ~42h, SMS branch ~6h for opted-in only.</p>
